  "description": "The Brilliant Cooper is a low maintenance, hassle free, everyday belt-drive bicycle. It is perfect for urban riders to vacation cruisers and everything in-between. Designed to be free from routine drivetrain maintenance, this bicycle is stylish enough for weekend rides, with features that are ready for the city or light-commuting grind. The bicycle accommodates most standard racks, fenders and baskets. Features: Grease and rust-free Gates belt drive. 3-Speed Shimano Nexus internally geared rear hub Strong and lightweight frame (27lbs total weight) Freewheel with front and rear V-brakes Durable 700 x 32 tires Accommodates most standard racks, fenders and baskets. All Coopers come with assembly tools, and kickstand. Diamond Frame available in three sizes based on inseam measurement: Small (28”-30” inseam) Medium (30.5”-32.5” inseam) Large (33”-36” inseam)",
